  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div> <!-- Hero Section --> <section> <p> Back up, organize, and search vintage synth patches directly in your browser. The zero-config <span><span>MIDI-OX</span><span><svg preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 10\"> <line x1=\"-3\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"103\" y2=\"2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></line> </svg></span></span> alternative you deserve. <span>No driver wall, no app sprawl. One click backs it all.</span> </p> <!-- Interactive MIDI Detector (SaaS Style) --> <!-- Cable Warning --> <p> We recommend a high-quality interface like the Roland UM-ONE or iConnectivity mio. </p> <!-- Press & Social Proof Trust Bar --> <div> <p><span>AS FEATURED IN</span></p><div> <p><span>Synthtopia</span> <span>•</span></p><p><img src=\"https://bipluk.com/static/modwiggler.svg\" alt=\"ModWiggler\"> <span>ModWiggler</span> </p> <p><span>•</span> <img src=\"https://ecosistemastartup.com/wp-content/themes/esup-child/assets/img/logo-light.svg\" alt=\"Ecosistema Startup\"> </p></div> </div> <!-- Real Technical Specs Banner --> <div> <p><span id=\"live-patch-counter\" data-initial=\"740\">740</span> <span>PATCHES BACKED UP</span> </p> <p><span>53</span> <span>ACTIVE USERS</span> </p> <p><span>4</span> <span>HAPPY BIPLUKERS</span> </p> </div> <!-- Symmetric Preview Grid (Physical Synth vs. Virtual App) --> </section> <!-- The Problem Section --> <div id=\"problem\"> <h2>Why backups feel <span id=\"rn-1995\" data-color=\"#ef4444\">stuck in 1995</span>.</h2> <p>Synthesizers are built to last forever, but the digital tools to manage them didn't keep up.</p> </div> <!-- Visual Detail Feature Break --> <!-- Three Core Pillars (Visual Steps) --> <div id=\"features\"> <p> <h2>Abstracting 40 years of <span id=\"rn-friction\" data-color=\"#ef4444\">hardware friction</span>. </h2> </p> </div> <!-- Pricing Grid --> <section id=\"pricing\"> <div> <h2 id=\"pricing-title\">A pricing system built for fellow synth heads in the USA <img src=\"https://bipluk.com/static/icons/flags/Rect/US_United_States_rect.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"24\" alt=\"\"></h2> <p> Vintage synthesizers are musical history. Batteries fade, but <span id=\"rn-timebomb\">your patches don't have to</span>. <span id=\"rn-securesounds\">Protect your creative work with simple, reliable backups and keep your hardware alive.</span> </p> </div> <!-- Pricing Cards --> <!-- Value anchor --> <p> <span>Desktop librarians</span> often cost <span>USD $<span id=\"pricing-anchor-competitor-amount\">200</span>+</span>. <span>bipluk+</span> is just <span><span id=\"pricing-anchor-personal-symbol\">$</span><span id=\"pricing-anchor-personal-amount\">49</span></span> once. <span>Saving over 80% never sounded  better.</span> </p> <!-- Centered Meme Image --> <p><img src=\"https://bipluk.com/m/trade_offer.avif?t=InRyYWRlX29mZmVyLmF2aWYi.aoF6AA._VBbp7Ol3rIBKpa0PKqAfO72T-M\" alt=\"Meme\" width=\"380\" height=\"513\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 380px, 380px\"> </p> </section> <!-- FAQ Chat (accordion hidden; JSON-LD retained for SEO) --> <div id=\"faq\"> <p><img src=\"https://bipluk.com/static/talk_animation.gif\" alt=\"Talking Duck\"></p><h2>Ask bipluk</h2> <p><img src=\"https://bipluk.com/static/walk_animation.gif\" alt=\"Running Away Duck\"> </p></div> <!-- Footer --> <!-- Third-Party External Link Confirmation Modal (Shake Shack Corporate Style) --> <!-- Contact & Support Email Modal --> <!-- Lazy Loading script for MP4 Videos --> <!-- Clash Royale Style Mobile Bottom Navigation -->\n<nav> <a href=\"https://bipluk.com/#features\"> <img src=\"https://bipluk.com/static/icons/dinkie/bigger.svg\" alt=\"Features\"> <span>Features</span> </a> <a href=\"https://bipluk.com/#pricing\"> <img id=\"mobile-nav-pricing-icon\" src=\"https://bipluk.com/static/icons/dinkie/money-bag-usd.svg\" alt=\"Pricing\"> <span>Pricing</span> </a> <a href=\"https://bipluk.com/resources\"> <img src=\"https://bipluk.com/static